2671","id":3521986989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R7UGt","user":{"login":"EtiTheSpirit","id":10490540,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDkwNTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10490540?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit","html_url":"https://github.com/EtiTheSpirit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EtiTheSpirit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T13:37:02Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T13:37:02Z","body":"Excellent. Providing the SDK did indeed solve the issue, and I've taken the liberty of integrating the other modules into my build too, figured I might as well cover as many bases as I can since I want to be as broadly compatible as I can manage, but I digress. Thank you for your help.\n\nSince this resolved my issue (after a looooooong rebuild) I'll go ahead and close this as resolved.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521986989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]